## Market Selection

Hunter supports three market-universe modes.

| Mode | Behavior |
|---|---|
| `MANUAL` | Uses the operator-selected market universe. |
| `AUTO` | Discovers eligible active USDT linear perpetual swaps through the Classified integration boundary. |
| `HYBRID` | Combines automatically discovered markets with manually selected markets. |

`MANUAL` is the default and preserves the operator-selected universe.

Automatic discovery is separate from liquidity detection and setup qualification.

### Configuration

```dotenv
HUNTER_MARKET_SELECTION_MODE=manual
HUNTER_AUTO_MARKET_LIMIT=20
HUNTER_AUTO_MARKET_REFRESH_SECONDS=900
```

The market limit and automatic refresh interval can be adjusted through configuration.

